abstract: >-
  RAVEL connects scientific questions to plans, physics tools, reviewed results and the next
  experiment. It supports collider research and reinterpretation, supplied-event analysis,
  model calculations, statistical inference and iterative research workflows.
keywords:
  - high-energy physics
  - collider research
  - reinterpretation
  - supplied-event analysis
  - model calculations
  - statistical inference
  - iterative research workflows
